<title>UK: SOCCER-COTTEE JOINS LEICESTER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-COTTEE JOINS LEICESTER.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Former England striker Tony Cottee signed for premier league Leicester City on Friday in a 500,000 pounds ($795,000) transfer from Malaysian club Selangor.</p>
<p>The 32-year-old former Everton and West Ham forward said: &quot;To be honest, when I left West Ham at 31 I thought I would not see the premier league again.</p>
<p>&quot;I am a marksman, a goalscorer, and if Leicester need someone like that, either in the team or to come off the bench, I will be ready to step in.&quot;</p>
</text>
